        <mxCell id="p8ct" value="8 · Context Management &amp;amp; Harness&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;How tool output is bounded before it reaches the model — and what shapes the model's behaviour&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
