        <mxCell id="p9t" value="10 · Component Index&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Every component, where it lives, and which tab draws it — &lt;i&gt;component&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;path or detail&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;tab&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
